<title>USA: Telxon gets injunction vs Symbol Tech.</title>
<headline>Telxon gets injunction vs Symbol Tech.</headline>
<dateline>AKRON, Ohio 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telxon Corp said that the U.S. District Court, Northern District of Ohio, has granted its request for a preliminary injunction against Symbol Technologies Inc, enjoining Symbol from continuing to allegedly make false and misleading statements about Symbol's frequency hopping wireless network, Spectrum 24.</p>
<p>In addition, the court ordered a public retraction of the allegedly false and misleading statements which have appeared in various forms of advertising and public communications made by Symbol.</p>
</text>
